# Pairs with OrphanRecoverable. Merge drops the only published route before work starts.
MODULE: MergeBeginOrphansSibling
TARGET: OrphanRecoverable
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a merge start leaves a born sibling without a route or recovery record
PERTURBS: MergeBegin

--- FIND
MergeBegin ==
    /\ phase = "ready"
    /\ linked
    /\ phase' = "merging"
    /\ linked' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: withdraw the parent route before moving rows.
MergeBegin ==
    /\ phase = "ready"
    /\ linked
    /\ phase' = "merging"
    /\ linked' = FALSE
--- END
